cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use datanuggets, please cite the article that introduced data
  nuggets, given below.
title: datanuggets
abstract: >-
  A native Python port of the R packages datanugget and WCluster. It reduces
  a large dataset to weighted data nuggets, then clusters them, explores them
  with weighted PCA and maps cluster labels back to the original rows.
type: software
